From: YanIanZ <iwayanbagusaryadarma@student.telkomuniversity.ac.id>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 02:03:07 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] SourbyCraft - legacy PlayerPreLoginEvent on the global tick

The region-threading base never fired the deprecated synchronous
PlayerPreLoginEvent (its Waitable went to the main-thread queue, which
nothing drains), so a legacy whitelist/ban/limit plugin listening only
to it got no callback. It is fired again as Paper fires it: after
AsyncPlayerPreLoginEvent, only when it has listeners, pre-set from the
async result, and its own final result decides. LegacyPreLogin runs it
on the global tick while the authentication thread waits, bounded
(10 s to start, 10 s more to finish); an unanswered check refuses the
login.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/network/ServerLoginPacketListenerImpl.java b/net/minecraft/server/network/ServerLoginPacketListenerImpl.java
index 01dcf0f14bb6d7e99fdab5434121668a683d1982..c5679e538738fa752091a4ca4bdf70ba711809cd 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/server/network/ServerLoginPacketListenerImpl.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/server/network/ServerLoginPacketListenerImpl.java
@@ -356,22 +356,14 @@ public class ServerLoginPacketListenerImpl implements ServerLoginPacketListener,
         uniqueId = gameprofile.id();
         // Paper end - Add more fields to AsyncPlayerPreLoginEvent
 
-        if (false && PlayerPreLoginEvent.getHandlerList().getRegisteredListeners().length != 0) { // Folia - region threading
+        if (dev.iyanz.sourbycraft.guards.LegacyPreLogin.hasListeners()) { // SourbyCraft - legacy PlayerPreLoginEvent on the global tick, bounded wait
             final PlayerPreLoginEvent event = new PlayerPreLoginEvent(playerName, address, uniqueId);
             if (asyncEvent.getResult() != PlayerPreLoginEvent.Result.ALLOWED) {
                 event.disallow(asyncEvent.getResult(), asyncEvent.kickMessage()); // Paper - Adventure
             }
-            Waitable<PlayerPreLoginEvent.Result> waitable = new Waitable<>() {
-                @Override
-                protected PlayerPreLoginEvent.Result evaluate() {
-                    server.getPluginManager().callEvent(event);
-                    return event.getResult();
-                }
-            };
-
-            ServerLoginPacketListenerImpl.this.server.processQueue.add(waitable);
-            if (waitable.get() != PlayerPreLoginEvent.Result.ALLOWED) {
-                this.disconnect(io.papermc.paper.adventure.PaperAdventure.asVanilla(event.kickMessage())); // Paper - Adventure
+            final net.kyori.adventure.text.Component kickMessage = dev.iyanz.sourbycraft.guards.LegacyPreLogin.fire(event, server.getPluginManager()::callEvent); // SourbyCraft - legacy PlayerPreLoginEvent on the global tick, bounded wait
+            if (kickMessage != null) { // SourbyCraft - legacy PlayerPreLoginEvent on the global tick, bounded wait
+                this.disconnect(io.papermc.paper.adventure.PaperAdventure.asVanilla(kickMessage)); // Paper - Adventure
             }
         } else {
             if (asyncEvent.getLoginResult() != AsyncPlayerPreLoginEvent.Result.ALLOWED) {
